FORM K-1.
IN THE MATTER OF: the-new-advocate.
FILED BY: the firm, pleased with its hire, unsure of the precedent.

OFF THE RECORD: Bucephalus, Alexander's battle horse, has been
OFF THE RECORD: admitted to the bar. A power of attorney is an office
OFF THE RECORD: as a value: the same instrument, exercised the same
OFF THE RECORD: way, whatever office it happens to confer. In
OFF THE RECORD: Alexander's day the power conferred the charge; today,
OFF THE RECORD: his flanks unburdened by the loins of a rider, it
OFF THE RECORD: confers the reading of the old books. The petitions
OFF THE RECORD: need not change, and nobody at the bar need know.

INCORPORATE BY REFERENCE statutes-of-delegation.

ARTICLE 1.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT bucephalus IS A POWER OF ATTORNEY OVER THE OFFICE OF charging.
    PROCLAIM THE FINDING UNDER bucephalus REGARDING "Granicus".

ARTICLE 2.
    OFF THE RECORD: The conversion. The instrument is re-executed; the
    OFF THE RECORD: exercises that follow do not mention it.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT bucephalus IS A POWER OF ATTORNEY OVER THE OFFICE OF studying.
    PROCLAIM THE FINDING UNDER bucephalus REGARDING "Granicus".

ARTICLE 3.
    LET IT BE RECORDED THAT the-old-books IS A SCHEDULE COMPRISING "the code of the field" AND "the register of wounds" AND "the settled peace".
    PROCLAIM THE FINDING OF applied-to-each REGARDING bucephalus AND the-old-books.
    PROCLAIM "So perhaps it is best, as Bucephalus has done, to bury oneself in the old books.".
    ADJOURN INDEFINITELY.

THE OFFICE OF charging, CONCERNING cause.
    REMAND WITH "charges at " PLUS cause PLUS ", flanks burdened, dust attending".

THE OFFICE OF studying, CONCERNING cause.
    REMAND WITH "reads " PLUS cause PLUS " by quiet lamplight".
